      <p>Blanks that look great in team colors, from classic truckers to flat-brim snapbacks. Not sure? Start an order and we'll help.</p>
      <div class="ind-hats">
        <div class="ind-hat"><div class="ind-hat-photo" data-n="3"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/charcoal-neon-yellow.jpg?v=1785626679&width=400&format=webp" alt="Richardson 112 Trucker" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/black-white-red.jpg?v=1785626680&width=400&format=webp" alt="Richardson 112 Trucker" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/all-black.jpg?v=1785626679&width=400&format=webp" alt="Richardson 112 Trucker" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ind-hat-body"><strong>Richardson 112 Trucker</strong><span>The classic team trucker. Structured, mesh-backed, and available in just about every color combo.</span></div></div>
        <div class="ind-hat"><div class="ind-hat-photo" data-n="3"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/fp-loden_green-black.jpg?v=1785794828&width=400&format=webp" alt="Richardson 112 5-Panel Trucker" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/fp-black.jpg?v=1785794828&width=400&format=webp" alt="Richardson 112 5-Panel Trucker" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/fp-charcoal-white.jpg?v=1785794828&width=400&format=webp" alt="Richardson 112 5-Panel Trucker" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ind-hat-body"><strong>Richardson 112 5-Panel Trucker</strong><span>Structured 5-panel trucker with a flat front panel. Bold, modern, and great in team colors.</span></div></div>
        <div class="ind-hat"><div class="ind-hat-photo" data-n="3"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/royal-blue-natural.jpg?v=1785628631&width=400&format=webp" alt="Otto 5-Panel Mid Profile" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/black-natural.jpg?v=1785628631&width=400&format=webp" alt="Otto 5-Panel Mid Profile" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/black.jpg?v=1785628632&width=400&format=webp" alt="Otto 5-Panel Mid Profile" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ind-hat-body"><strong>Otto 5-Panel Mid Profile</strong><span>Budget-friendly all-cotton cap in tons of colors. Keeps cost low for a full roster.</span></div></div>
        <div class="ind-hat"><div class="ind-hat-photo" data-n="3"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/yp_royal_white.jpg?v=1787188971&width=400&format=webp" alt="Yupoong 6606 Retro Trucker" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/yp_green_camo.jpg?v=1787188971&width=400&format=webp" alt="Yupoong 6606 Retro Trucker" loading="lazy"><img src="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0974/8453/7988/files/yp_turqoise_white.jpg?v=1787188971&width=400&format=webp" alt="Yupoong 6606 Retro Trucker" loading="lazy"></div><div class="ind-hat-body"><strong>Yupoong 6606 Retro Trucker</strong><span>Affordable retro trucker with wide appeal. A fan favorite for fundraiser runs.</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="ind-section">
    <h2>Team orders and fundraising</h2>
    <div class="ind-usecase">
      <h3>Logos, locations, and deadlines</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Team logo on the front, or add branding on the side or back. We send a mockup showing each location before production.</li>
        <li>Running a fundraiser? Choose a retail-quality blank, order at volume pricing, and sell the finished hats to players, parents, and supporters.</li>
        <li>Have a season opener, tournament, or event deadline? Contact us before ordering so we can confirm the timeline.</li>
        <li>Order extras for coaches, parents, and fans alongside the roster set.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ind-section">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <div class="ind-steps">
      <div class="ind-step"><div class="num">01</div><strong>Pick your hats</strong><span>Choose your blank, colors, and quantity. Send your team logo in any format, we digitize it for embroidery free.</span></div>
      <div class="ind-step"><div class="num">02</div><strong>Approve your mockup</strong><span>We send a free digital proof so you can see your logo in team colors before we stitch a single hat.</span></div>
      <div class="ind-step"><div class="num">03</div><strong>We embroider &amp; ship</strong><span>Your team's hats are embroidered in-house in Burlington, NC and shipped free. Production typically takes 2-3 weeks after mockup approval, and shipping transit time is additional.</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>


  <section class="ind-section">
    <div class="ind-crosslinks">
      <p>We also work with:</p>
      <a href="/pages/custom-hats-for-landscaping-companies">Landscaping</a><a href="/pages/custom-hats-for-construction-companies">Construction</a><a href="/pages/custom-hats-for-small-businesses">Small Businesses</a><a href="/pages/custom-hats-for-motorsports-teams">Motorsports</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="ind-final">
    <h2>Ready to gear up the team?</h2>
    <p>Start a custom order in minutes, or request a quote for a bigger run. Our minimum is 5 hats, with wholesale pricing beginning at ten. Free shipping and free logo setup.</p>
    <div class="ind-cta-row">
      <a href="/pages/custom-order" class="ind-cta">Start a Custom Order</a>
      <a href="/pages/quote" class="ind-cta-alt">Request a Special Quote</a>
    </div>
    <span class="ind-cta-sub">Questions first? Email help@threadbreak.com</span>
  </section>
</div>
